{
  "_help": [
    "KnobRing settings. Save this file and the app reloads it automatically.",
    "apps: the .exe names a ring is for (see Task Manager > Details). A ring with no apps is the fallback for every other app.",
    "Up to 12 items per ring (8 looks best). The first item sits at the top, the rest go clockwise.",
    "type keys  : value is a shortcut like Ctrl+Shift+E, Space, F2, Alt+Left, Win+Shift+S. Several in a row: Ctrl+K, Ctrl+C",
    "type run   : value is an app, file, folder or website to open; args is optional",
    "type text  : value is text to type",
    "type media : value is mute, playpause, next, prev, stop, volup or voldown",
    "type ring  : value is the name of another ring to open (a sub-ring gets a Back slot)",
    "icon: a name from the list in the tray menu (Icon names), OR 1-3 letters like V, OR a path to a .png file",
    "accent: highlight colour as #RRGGBB. size: 0.6 to 2.0. timeoutSeconds: ring closes after this long with no input"
  ],
  "settings": {
